#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2261 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "RPATHCD at the 20-character boundary (row 2) is conformant; a shorter value and an empty value never fire."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-1
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SETCD   type=Char label="Set Code"
col RPATHCD type=Char label="Planned Repro Path Code"
---
S1 | DM | 001 | GRP1 | F0MALE
S1 | DM | 002 | GRP2 | PATH-COHORT-F0-MALE1
S1 | DM | 003 | GRP3 |
